# AI Ecosystem
# Shared memory (.ai/memory/shared/) is COMMITTED — versioned team knowledge.
# Private memory is per-developer session scratch; keep the folder, ignore contents.
.ai/memory/private/*
!.ai/memory/private/.gitkeep
.ai/local/
